---
import { stages, sourceUrl } from './trace-data';
---

<details class="transcript">
  <summary>Read the complete request flow</summary>
  <div>
    <p>
      This is an illustration of the implemented search path, not a recording of
      a production request. Index preparation happens separately.
    </p>
    <ol>
      {stages.map((stage) => (
        <li>
          <strong>{stage.title}.</strong> {stage.detail}{' '}
          <a href={sourceUrl(stage.file)}>Source implementation</a>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
    <p>
      An invalid key stops at authentication. An empty search returns no
      matches. Neither outcome should be presented as a successful generated
      answer.
    </p>
  </div>
</details>
<style>
  .transcript {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 20px 0;
  }
  .transcript summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 8px 0;
  }
  .transcript > div {
    max-width: 75ch;
    padding-top: 20px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  li {
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
</style>
